awhitebalance_setcolortemperature_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setColorTemperature</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setColorTemperature</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">colorTemperature</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To set color temperatur. Unit: kelvin. The color temperature can only be set when the white balance mode is set to <code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_camerawhitebalancemode_manual\">MANUAL</a></code>.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>colorTemperature</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> </code></span></td><td>Color temperature value to be set in the range of [20, 100]. Real color temperature value (K) = value * 100. For example, 50 -&gt; 5000K.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>